note: repeated literal [take] clauses COMPOSE — each truncates the
note: relation, so the minimum wins (code.md §7.9 λ tail). The pre-W4
note: engine kept the LAST take (last-wins overwrite), which broke the
note: ruled limit≡take collapse under multiplicity.
#]]
