 [case id=cmd-027-tier2-scope-and-name-excluded level=core
  [tags def command tier2 computation-id scope name exclusion pair stream-14 686 g2]
  [meta [#
note: G2, the S0 exclusion set beyond cmd-011's clauses: scope= is out
note: (visibility is not computation), and the DEF NAME ITSELF is out —
note: computes-as addresses the COMPUTATION, not the binding; trust and
note: naming are Tier-1's job (L139). f and g with identical
note: params/body share one Tier-2 address.
