     remaining expressions never evaluate. Resolves #530: a failed effect
     is loud without a dummy [?let] binding to swallow it. ]
  [in-cx [#
[empty]
#]]
  [in-code [#
[?let [= $c [x]] [?do 'fine' [$concat '' $c@nope] 'never-reached']]
#]]
  [out-text [#
[err code=cx-err:CXER0100 message='concat: argument 2 is absence (the empty sequence) — a single scalar (or a node atomizing to one) is required; bind it or default it with [?else] first (code.md §6.5)']
#]]
 ]

 [case id=program-for-where-call-001-fn-call-predicate level=core
  [tags for where predicate function-call]
  [; #537(a) regression pin — a function call inside a [where …] clause
