 [# ── takewhile/dropwhile RETIRED SPELLINGS (stream 13, L55): the clause
       names are take-while / drop-while (the vocabulary's kebab rule; the
       registry's only non-kebab multi-word names are gone). The old
       spellings tombstone-error loudly — a silent pattern-generator
       fallback would change meaning, never do that. ── #]
