 # ── #457 — `::T` ascription over auto-typed literal tokens ──────────────────
 # Lexicon §7 [L50]/[L51]: an explicit ascription OVERRIDES §9 auto-typing —
 # the ORIGINAL source token is what coerces to T, exactly as the data reading
 # does (parser coerce_scalar_checked). Pre-fix the program reading auto-typed
 # `0x…` to int (clamping over-i64 hex to i64 max) BEFORE the ascription
 # applied, silently corrupting short-hex bytes values.

 [case id=program-bytes-ascription-001-short-hex level=core
  [tags type-annotation bytes hex issue-457]
  [in-cx [#
[empty]
#]]
